                                                                                            <ul class="fa-ul custom   " style="margin-left:0px;"> <li class="custom" style="font-size:14px;">@*<i class="fa-li fa fa-trash"></i>*@The MIS System is a user-friendly information portal designed for people working in the areas of ground water and related fields. It gives easier access to hydrogeological information alongside information about weather, geology and water harvesting structures for water budgeting and water security planning in the long run.</li>  </ul>

                                                                                        </div>
