                                                                            <h4 class="accordion_title">
                                                                                <a class="accordion_toggle collapsed" data-parent="#stacks_in_305_page9_accordion" data-toggle="collapse" href="#stacks_in_292_page9_collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stacks_in_292_page9_collapse">
                                                                                    <span class="closed-item-icon"><img src="~/Images/5.png" /></span><span class="open-item-icon"><img src="~/Images/5.png" /></span> I do not have an account with ABHY’s MIS System ?

                                                                                </a>
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div id="stacks_in_292_page9_collapse" class="panel-collapse collapse" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="heading_stacks_in_292_page9" aria-expanded="false" style="height: 0px;">
                                                                                <div class="accordion_content">
                                                                                    <div id="stacks_out_303_page9" class="stacks_out">
                                                                                        <div id="stacks_in_303_page9" class="stacks_in com_elixir_stacks_foundryParagraph_stack">

                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                You are welcome to open it now. It is very easy to open an account with ABHY’s MIS System. You can directly go to the “MIS Login” page and click on the register button and provide few personal information included in the system. A link will be sent to your registered email address. You can login with the same credentials in the future.

                                                                                            </p>


                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </div>
