                                                                                        <div id="stacks_in_334_page9" class="stacks_in com_elixir_stacks_foundryParagraph_stack">

                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                The Ground Water Monitoring System of MIS helps in understanding the changing water storage conditions at a particular place. The data collected by monitoring ground water is used to determine its availability, usage and deviation from rainfall with user specific location information.

                                                                                            </p>


                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                </div>
