                                                                                    <span class="closed-item-icon"><i class="fa fa-comment fa-fw"></i></span><span class="open-item-icon"><i class="fa fa-comment fa-fw"></i></span>What is special about the Water Budgeting System of MIS ?
                                                                                </a>
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div id="stacks_in_337_page9_collapse" class="panel-collapse collapse  " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="heading_stacks_in_337_page9" aria-expanded="false">
                                                                                <div class="accordion_content">
                                                                                    <div id="stacks_out_339_page9" class="stacks_out">
                                                                                        <div id="stacks_in_339_page9" class="stacks_in com_elixir_stacks_foundryParagraph_stack">

                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                ater Budgeting System gives an account of all the water that flows into and out of an area. The main function of water budgeting tool is to estimate the amount of water a landscape will have, based on its recharge and draft capacity. Water budgeting parameters takes into account reference rainfall data, irrigated landscape area, water sources data and, the purpose and functionality of the landscape

                                                                                            </p>


                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </div>
