                                                                            <h4 class="accordion_title">
                                                                                <a class="accordion_toggle collapsed" data-parent="#stacks_in_305_page9_accordion" data-toggle="collapse" href="#stacks_in_342_page9_collapse" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stacks_in_342_page9_collapse">
                                                                                    <span class="closed-item-icon"><i class="fa fa-camera fa-fw"></i></span><span class="open-item-icon"><i class="fa fa-camera fa-fw"></i></span> What is special about the Water Security System of MIS ?
                                                                                </a>
                                                                            </h4>
                                                                            <div id="stacks_in_342_page9_collapse" class="panel-collapse collapse  " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="heading_stacks_in_342_page9" aria-expanded="false">
                                                                                <div class="accordion_content">
                                                                                    <div id="stacks_out_344_page9" class="stacks_out">
                                                                                        <div id="stacks_in_344_page9" class="stacks_in com_elixir_stacks_foundryParagraph_stack">

                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                Water Security System helps in safeguarding adequate quantities of quality water for sustaining livelihoods, human well-being, and socio-economic development. The main purpose of ABHY’s Water Security tool is to estimate the total water budget required for managing adequate quantities of water resources based on its demand and supply.

                                                                                            </p>


                                                                                        </div>
                                                                                    </div>
                                                                                </div>
