                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                Geo Climate Risk Solutions Pvt Ltd is responsible for maintaining the website. It is responsible for design, development, maintenance, upgradation of content as per the requirements of the program.</p>
</div>
                                                                                    </div>
