                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                In order to register a complaint/grievance you have to provide some information like the subject, grievance type, grievance addressed to etc. with a supported document. This complaint will be further directed to the concerned department for a quick review and the necessary remedies will be taken.

                                                                                            </p>


