                                                                                        <div id="stacks_in_369_page9" class="stacks_in com_elixir_stacks_foundryParagraph_stack">

                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                The “Dashboard Module” of ABHY is a complete suite of state specific water information. It provides a platform where users can get information about the annual water budget, annual water availability/recharge, annual water draft, annual gap assessment etc. of all the states at one glance. This data not only supports enhanced decision making but also identifies the gaps between states in managing their water resources.

                                                                                            </p>


