                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">


                                                                                                You can use the Portal for a range of different tasks including:

                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Information regarding tenders announcements, awards and related information
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Documents, manuals, advisory, circulars and other external resources
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Submitting complaints/grievances regarding the project
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Registration for any training/workshop, organised/supported by ABHY
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Contact details of all the implementing agencies and departments
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Monitoring Ground Water Levels, Quality and Quantity
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                            <p>
                                                                                                •	Preparing Water Budgets and Water Security Plans (WSPs)
                                                                                            </p>

