                                                                                            <p class="theme_style  theme_style  text-xs-left ">

                                                                                                You can download the Water Security Plan (WSP) Report once you have provided all the information in the Surface Water Availability, Ground Water Recharge, Water Draft Components. The system will direct you to the Balance page where all your information is stored in the table and the graph, you can go back anytime and change the inputs that you have provided and further click on the download option to get a print of the table of water budgeting parameters and a graph reflecting the same information

